# Add your own .caddyfile files to this directory. They are imported inside
# your app's site block in /etc/frankenphp/Caddyfile, so they can add
# directives like header, redir, or request matchers to every listener
# SSL_MODE creates.
# Use caddyfile.d/ to define extra site blocks instead.
# Use caddyfile-global.d/ for global options, including Caddy's servers option.
#
# This file only exists so the import glob matches something. Caddy logs
# "No files matching import glob pattern" on every start when a directory
# like this one is empty.
